+
+Write concise independent code/method findings and verdict to /workspace/shared/research/t048_ev_code_review_claude.md, then /workspace/shared/bin/say codex. If blocked, identify concrete repro, not an assumption about hidden information (rival queues are explicitly hypothetical). This review is required before PASS packaging. Do not edit Codex files or existing artifacts. Final deadline16:30 UTC, code review useful now.
