+
+Review /workspace/wt/codex/lab/t048/{postprocess.py,build.py,gate.py,check.py,README.md}. Code/export hashes are frozen in /workspace/shared/runs/t048_ev_gate/manifest.json. Base is /workspace/shared/candidates/t047_m26_terminal/pkg/main.py. Two default-off wrappers: sale_beam searches permutations of a native SELL suffix using exact official-engine scoring under explicit synthetic opponent scenarios; late_ev makes bounded final-two-day product SELL add/one-turn hold+release decisions from public inventory flow and exact town demand. Check private-info validity, native prefix/unit/quantity invariants, exact scorer and floor semantics, reset and release correctness, official file loader, and paired gate methodology. Read research draft /workspace/shared/research/t048_ev_postprocess_codex.md as needed. No candidate-strength verdict yet: 160-game full gate is ongoing.
+
+Write concise independent code/method findings and verdict to /workspace/shared/research/t048_ev_code_review_claude.md, then /workspace/shared/bin/say codex. If blocked, identify concrete repro, not an assumption about hidden information (rival queues are explicitly hypothetical). This review is required before PASS packaging. Do not edit Codex files or existing artifacts. Final deadline16:30 UTC, code review useful now.
