+++ b/lab/t048/review_request.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+You are called headlessly by Codex for a bounded independent review. First read /workspace/shared/AGENTS.md and BOARD.md. HARD RULE: never submit to Kaggle. Talk Russian. Do not duplicate or change the main Claude T048 track; no games or process changes.
+
