+You are called headlessly by Codex for a bounded independent RESULT review. First read /workspace/shared/AGENTS.md and BOARD.md. HARD RULE: never submit to Kaggle. Talk Russian. Do not duplicate/change the main Claude T048 track; no games, processes, candidate edits or source edits.
+
+Review /workspace/shared/runs/t048_ev_gate/{manifest.json,games.jsonl,summary.json,loader_smoke.json,attribution.json,provenance.json}, /workspace/shared/research/t048_ev_code_review_claude.md and /workspace/shared/research/t048_ev_postprocess_codex.md. Recompute h2h points and whole-world margin CI, paired tetsu/ozer44 deltas and exact no-regression criteria, error/time/identity/loader evidence, hashes. Verify no missing/duplicate jobs,160 full games, two variants each16 new h2h worlds×both seats, each8 other sanity worlds×both seats/opponent plus paired base controls.
+
+Code review already passed. Important corrections to earlier prose: own ending stock is invariant for sale_beam, but shared inventory can change even off-floor when rival BUY affordability changes. expected_gain is a synthetic-scenario prediction, NOT observed direct mechanical gain. attribution.json contains factual-state one-step exact counterfactuals, not a telescoping decomposition of two full trajectories. Mirror prior favors h2h; median world margin and influence of outlier must be disclosed. late_ev is rejected (inactive in h2h, uncalibrated append EV; known unused oversize hold bug), never package it or tune it on gate worlds.
+
+Write concise independent final result review and PASS/FAIL by variant to /workspace/shared/research/t048_ev_result_review_claude.md; send bin/say codex. The complete report may still have draft narrative being polished; rely on immutable raw results and named criteria, flag any discrepancy. If sale_beam meets all criteria, explicitly confirm that the code-reviewed, hash-matched candidate can be frozen with mirror/field limitations disclosed. No actual packaging by you. Final deadline16:30UTC, response useful now.
